meta {
  name: Get Trip Summary
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trip-days/trip/1/summary
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Trip Summary

  Get a statistical summary of all trip days for a trip.

  ## URL Params
  - `{trip_id}`: ID of the trip to summarize

  ## Response
  Returns comprehensive statistics:
  - `trip_id`: ID of the trip
  - `total_days`: Total number of days in the trip
  - `countries`: Array of countries visited
  - `countries_count`: Number of unique countries
  - `cities`: Array of cities visited
  - `cities_count`: Number of unique cities
  - `day_types_breakdown`: Object with count of each day type
    - Example: `{"sightseeing": 5, "transit": 2, "leisure": 3}`
  - `total_activities`: Total number of planned activities
  - `total_bookings`: Total number of bookings
  - `total_accommodations`: Number of days with accommodation
  - `first_day`: Date of first day
  - `last_day`: Date of last day

  ## Use Cases
  - Dashboard overview
  - Trip planning insights
  - Checking trip coverage (days with activities, accommodations, etc.)
  - Understanding trip composition (mostly sightseeing vs leisure vs adventure)

  ## Access Control
  - Must have access to the parent trip
}
